---
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
const ja = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/ja/');
---
<Callout kind="warn" title={ja ? '次版 v1.2.0：遠隔操作には明示的なビルド opt-in が必要です' : 'Upcoming v1.2.0: remote automation requires an explicit build opt-in'}>
  {ja ? <p>v1.2.0 はまだ公開されていません。v1.1.2 の導入手順と、次版のビルド設定を区別してください。次版の通常 Shipping は遠隔実装を含まず、Release／Debug の選択や Player profile だけでは有効になりません。<a href="/ja/remote-builds/">必須フラグ・用途別の選択・移行手順</a>を確認してください。</p> : <p>v1.2.0 is not released yet. Keep the v1.1.2 installation instructions separate from the next version's build settings. Normal Shipping in the next version contains no remote implementation; choosing Release/Debug or the Player profile does not enable it. See <a href="/remote-builds/">required flags, build choices, and migration steps</a>.</p>}
</Callout>
